  "instructions": [
    "Heat the dashi broth in a saucepan over medium heat until steaming hot.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together soy sauce, sesame oil, salt, and sugar.",
    "In a separate bowl, toast the sesame seeds in a dry pan over low heat until fragrant.",
    "Add the toasted sesame seeds to the soy sauce mixture and whisk to combine.",
    "In a dolsot stone bowl, place a scoop of cooked Japanese rice.",
    "Pour the hot dashi broth over the rice, then sprinkle the toasted sesame seeds mixture evenly over the top.",
    "Add the grated daikon, green onions, pickled ginger, and crispy sesame seeds.",
    "Garnish with chopped scallions and a sprinkle of crushed red pepper.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!",
    "In a small saucepan, combine miso paste and water over low heat, whisking until smooth.",
    "In a separate saucepan, combine kombu dashi and water over low heat, whisking until smooth.",
    "Strain the kombu dashi mixture through a fine-mesh sieve into a bowl.",
    "Add the miso paste mixture to the strained kombu dashi and whisk until combined.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the ochazuke hot in the dolsot stone bowl, garnished with chopped scallions and a sprinkle of crushed red pepper.",
    "Heat a small amount of sesame oil in a pan over low heat, then add the ground perilla leaves and stir-fry until fragrant.",
    "Add the cooked Japanese rice to the pan and stir-fry until well combined with the perilla leaves.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together soy sauce, sesame oil, salt, and sugar.",
    "Add the soy sauce mixture to the rice mixture and stir-fry for a few more minutes.",
    "Then, transfer the rice mixture to the dolsot stone bowl and serve hot, garnished with chopped scallions and a sprinkle of crushed red pepper."
  ],
